~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_cop and StoryFlage.met_detective
	=> first_dialogue
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_dialogue
Cop: Where is the detective?
Roadie: He's occupied with the porcelain palace, said he won't make it out tonight.
Cop: I told him that food cart across from the station was dirty
Roadie: He trusted me to proxy for him around here, get the case solved and get everyone home
Cop: Ok, just keep me updated. And remember: No one leaves until this is sorted!
$> StoryFlags.met_cop = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Cop: Hey, what's nine plus ten?
Roadie: Don't do this to me
Cop: 25!
Roadie: ...
=> END
